WEBVTT

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:43.440
The Holy Kingdom of Ryoza, founded by King Je when He descended from Ephon Noha, is governed by the Queen.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:55.070
The beast-lord alongside King Je's refined figure, with its white wings, appeared holy in the people's eyes

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:59.350
and has been honored as the people's inspiration.

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:08.170
The Queen is guarded within the palace and is treated as the treasure of this country.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:15.590
<i>That naïve side of you will eventually cost you your life.</i>

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.000
<i>We're Sezans.</i>

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:20.430
<i>Remember that!</i>

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:36.220
The Sezans are elite bodyguards who protect the Queen.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:44.570
One of them, Ial, met a girl four years ago named Erin.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:52.130
And within Erin he found a personality and circumstance similar to his own.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.150
Welcome.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.010
Ial!

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:17.600
Ial...

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.190
It's you, isn't it, Ial?!

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.800
I don't know anyone by that name.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.510
W-Wait!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.270
I won't tell anyone.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.290
Don't go!  Please!

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:30.250
Don't you want to know what your family is up to now?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:33.970
<i>Ial.</i>

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:47.000
Ial the Sezan

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.260
Esal's answer is here.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.840
Um...  What does the letter say?

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:13.610
It's difficult.  It says you have to pass the Trial of the Entrees,

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:17.190
which happens only once a year, in order to gain entrance to the academy.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.910
And this year's Trial of the Entrees has already ended.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.490
Is that... so?

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:26.490
"However,

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:32.390
while I'd usually turn it down, this is a request from none other than my good friend Jone.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.870
I'm willing to administer a special Trial."

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:35.960
So it says.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:45.460
So I can take the Trial of the Entrees?

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:49.750
"However, I will be critiquing very strictly.

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.140
Since I will be administering this as a special case,

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:54.100
I expect you to score equal to or greater than the person who came in third during this year's test.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.770
If not, I will not hesitate to flunk you, so come prepared."

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.190
You hear that?

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.370
What are you going to do?

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.680
I'm going to go take the Trial.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:06.570
All right!  Let's head out right away!

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.160
Woohoo!  We're in the capital!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.920
There are loads of good food!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.480
It's a really good one.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.060
Woohoo!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.040
They're hopeless.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.150
They are.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:47.530
But it's also my first time coming to a city this big.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.540
Come on over, it's really cheap.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:59.500
Erin.  See that white building over there?

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.650
That's the palace.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:07.420
The palace where the Queen of the Holy Kingdom of Ryoza resides.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.090
A place not too flamboyant.

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:14.400
Simple, yet classy.

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:19.640
Just like the Queen herself.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:24.960
Oji-san, have you been inside the palace before?

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:32.200
When I was at Tamuyuan, there was a time when I was a tutor of Princess Seimiya, the successor.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.160
Wow!  You're amazing!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:41.130
But I blasted the usual gas during a celebration... and was fired.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:45.690
Kidding.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:46.550
I'm just kidding with you!

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:52.310
Hey there, young lady.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:54.770
How would you like this necklace?

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:57.230
It'll be something nice to take with you when you get married.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:59.870
"Married," you say?!

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:02.240
She's only fourteen!

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:07.380
But sir, fourteen is a prime age for young ladies.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:10.150
It'd be no surprise to see her leave your side in a day or two.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.240
No, it's too soon!  Too soon I say!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:16.460
Don't worry.  She'll become an adult once she gets married, like it or not.

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:17.770
I said it's too early!

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.620
What's wrong with making preparations for that day?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:19.980
You're so persistent!
What's wrong with making preparations for that day?

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:20.880
You're so persistent!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.100
Oh no!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:28.260
A shop for harps?

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:33.240
Do you know a place that can fix this?

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:38.810
There's a fellow called Yantoku at the outskirts of the city who's great at making instruments.

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:41.480
Maybe he can do something.

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.330
Yantoku-san?

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:03.090
It's well-made.  It's comparable to mine and I make a living out of them.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:06.070
Quit it.  Mine are just a hobby.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:12.730
Hobby, eh?

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:17.580
If you had succeeded your father's work, you would have been...

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.660
I said this is a hobby.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.920
I only make them because I like to.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.550
<i>Yantoku.</i>

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:36.970
<i>When I become older, I'll become a harp craftsman.</i>

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:43.240
<i>Just like your dad?</i>

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.060
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:49.640
<i>Fire!</i>

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:50.440
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.870
<i>It's coming from the shop!</i>

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.920
<i>Hey, Ial!</i>

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.880
<i>Where's he?  Where is my husband?!</i>

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:20.200
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.390
<i>Ial!</i>

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.480
<i>Where's Dad?</i>

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:29.110
<i>He's still in there.  Said he'd protect the harps.</i>

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.410
<i>Dad!</i>

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.840
Excuse me.

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:42.490
Um, is Yantoku-san here?

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:44.260
That'd be me.

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.880
I came here at the innkeeper's recommendation.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.230
Can you fix this harp?

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.530
Green eyes.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:54.520
That girl is...

00:11:56.010 --> 00:12:00.110
<i>What was that piece called?</i>

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:02.780
<i>"Bird of Dawn."</i>

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.930
<i>It's a very gentle, beautiful piece.</i>

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.790
This is a mess.

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:17.510
Where did you get a hold of this harp?

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.970
A certain someone gave it to me in the past.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:31.850
I only met him once, but if I ever meet him again, I want to say thank you.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:35.710
So I want you to fix this harp.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:41.970
Okay.  I'll do my best.

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:45.410
Thank you very much.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.800
This is your harp, isn't it?

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:08.190
She said she wanted to see you and say thank you.

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.670
Did something happen between you and her?

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.000
<i>The bird of dawn sings </i>

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.550
<i>You must be the egg thief. </i>
<i>The bird of dawn sings </i>

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:24.870
<i>The bird of dawn sings </i>

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:25.890
<i>Stop!</i>

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:26.890
<i>and it echoes throughout the lands. </i>
<i>Stop!</i>

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.450
<i>and it echoes throughout the lands. </i>

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.850
<i>Move. </i>
<i>and it echoes throughout the lands. </i>

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:30.320
<i>and it echoes throughout the lands. </i>

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.290
<i>No. </i>
<i>and it echoes throughout the lands. </i>

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.710
<i>and it echoes throughout the lands. </i>

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:43.930
<i>Don't cry.  Don't cry, o bird of dawn. </i>

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:48.600
<i>You remind me of your words. </i>

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:51.040
<i>I like this song. </i>
<i>You remind me of your words. </i>

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:51.940
<i>You remind me of your words. </i>

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:52.850
<i>Hearing this song reminds me of my mother.</i>
<i>You remind me of your words. </i>

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:53.240
<i>Hearing this song reminds me of my mother.</i>

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.680
<i>The morning mist dances, blown by breath. </i>
<i>Hearing this song reminds me of my mother.</i>

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:56.690
<i>The morning mist dances, blown by breath. </i>

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.630
<i>It sounded very gentle when you were playing it, too.</i>
<i>The morning mist dances, blown by breath. </i>

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:01.410
<i>The morning mist dances, blown by breath. </i>

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:06.320
<i>Please don't hurt my friends with the same hands that can play such a gentle song.</i>
<i>The morning mist dances, blown by breath. </i>

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:14.760
<i>My dear child, have a sweet dream. </i>

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:33.270
Hagal?  Why?

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.980
He disobeyed the Sezan code.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.430
Kill Hagal as soon as you find him.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.540
Kill Hagal...

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:08.780
<i>Excuse me, but you are...?</i>

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.010
<i>My name is Hagal.</i>

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:12.970
<i>Hagal?</i>

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:17.210
<i>I am one of the Sezans, the royal guard.</i>

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.790
<i>Also known as the Rigid Shield.</i>

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:25.880
<i>We require cutting off relationships from family, live abiding by a strict code, and go through rigorous training.</i>

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:30.760
<i>Only those who do so will be recognized as Sezans.</i>

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.160
Hagal...

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.170
Why did you go against the code?

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.590
<i>This is payment up-front.</i>

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.930
<i>Ten large gold nuggets.</i>

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.740
<i>Ten large gold nuggets...</i>

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:55.200
<i>You'll make a great Sezan.</i>

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:04.440
There was nothing else I could do for my sister and sickly mother after losing my father.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:07.780
<i>Mom!</i>

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:26.510
<i>Mom...</i>

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.100
<i>Ial!</i>

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.480
"Yantoku,

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:48.790
I regret having come in contact with you.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:51.290
I am a Sezan.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.250
I won't ever return here.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:58.490
Please give this harp to that girl."

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.500
Ial...

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.350
Don't, Ial.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:46.670
You're the one who saved my poor family.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.420
But I'm a Sezan!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.860
Thank you very much!

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:40.720
Man, I'm full!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:43.180
That old man can be nice.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:47.090
Yeah, giving us an allowance to eat anything we wanted.

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:49.000
Yup.  He's a nice guy.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:52.260
You guys look like easy targets.

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:54.180
Give us all the money you've got.

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:55.500
Who are you?

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.180
We won't give anything to you guys!

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.240
Is it going to require some pain for you guys to understand?

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:06.390
Stop it!  Stop it!

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:07.080
Let go!

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:12.340
Hey.  You don't have to save them?

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.520
We're Sezans.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.550
We mustn't stand out.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.310
We're heading back.

00:19:18.310 --> 00:19:21.000
If you're a Sezan, then shouldn't you understand?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:23.310
We're off duty right now.

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:25.270
Let go!

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:26.870
None of our business.

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:28.590
H-Hey!

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:31.020
He's so heartless.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:38.390
Hey, looks like luck is with me.

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:59.090
Kyle.  Stay out of external matters.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:05.720
We'll risk our life for the Queen, but ignore the evil on the street, eh?

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:09.020
What a terrible way to live.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:14.300
Our world considers kindness a weakness to be taken advantage of.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:20.240
When there's someone who's close, there will be someone who tries to use that person as a tool of negotiation.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:25.780
If you care for them, then stay away from them.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.440
Isn't it hard to live like that?

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:34.210
You've never felt sympathetic toward others?

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.340
<i>Hagal.</i>

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:08.650
<i>Hagal!</i>

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:21.580
I've killed too many to feel sympathy.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:47.460
It's great to see it all fixed.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:48.350
Yes.

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:50.410
But strange.

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:54.820
Harps show the style of their craftsman clearly.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:58.860
I'm amazed at how perfectly he fixed it.

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:03.520
A thought went through Erin's head:

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:10.460
"Maybe it was that man who fixed the harp."

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:19.960
She thought that she might be able to come across him sometime in her life.

00:22:20.660 --> 00:22:26.240
Then she made her way to Kazalm to take the Trial.

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:07.030
A birthday party for Harumiya-sama
will take place in the capital.

00:24:07.390 --> 00:24:11.620
I am invited to the palace, and there I meet Seimiya.

00:24:11.890 --> 00:24:15.800
It has been my dream to protect you.

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:18.450
So I must confess this now:

00:24:18.450 --> 00:24:22.180
The unfavorable side of this country and the Saigamuru.

00:24:22.180 --> 00:24:25.090
Kemono no Souja Erin.  The Targeted Queen.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:30.030
The Targeted Queen
